---
---

<section class="hero" id="home" aria-label="Introduzione">
  <div class="container hero__container">
    <div class="hero__content">
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">Oltre 4.000 clienti · Tutto il Piemonte</p>

      <h1 class="hero__title">
        Assistenza<br />
        <span class="hero__title-accent">stufe a pellet</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero__subtitle">
        Extraflame, Eva Calor e decine di altre marche.
        Interventi rapidi, anche nei weekend e nei festivi.
      </p>

      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a href="tel:3342968625" class="btn-primary">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 0 1 4.69 13a19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 3.6 2.18h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l.81-.81a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 17.16z"/>
          </svg>
          Chiama ora — 334 2968625
        </a>
        <a href="#percorso" class="btn-secondary btn-secondary--dark">Descrivi il problema</a>
      </div>
      <a href="tel:0172382695" class="hero__fisso">Oppure il fisso 0172 382695</a>

      <p class="hero__proof">
        Specialisti multibrand · Diagnosi e riparazione · Disponibili nei festivi
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="hero__frame">
      <img
        src="/hero-poster.jpg"
        alt="Intervento di assistenza su una stufa"
        width="1920"
        height="1080"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    color: var(--color-text);
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5.5rem) clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }

  .hero__container {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .hero__content {
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .hero__eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .hero__title {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--color-text-strong);
  }

  .hero__title-accent {
    color: #9a3412;
  }

  .hero__subtitle {
    max-width: 32rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .hero__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .hero__fisso {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  .hero__proof {
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .hero__frame {
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .hero__frame img {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 28rem;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero__actions {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .hero__actions .btn-primary,
    .hero__actions .btn-secondary {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
